  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think the devs should charge users for the SDK and the ability to upload avatars and worlds. So if you make a one time payment of £20, you can upload unlimited avatars and worlds within the current guidelines. Yeah people would get annoyed, but I think it's fair. Heck, maybe you can upload 2 avatars for free and 1 world. Then if you want unlimited uploads, pay the 20.\n\nIf you already have avatars and worlds, you can keep them uploaded for free, but if you want to add more, then you have to pay the 20.\n\nWhat do you guys think? It's in my best interest to support the game because it needs to be more secure and funded.",
